      <https://w3id.org/iadopt/ont/Variable>;
    dct:description "the temperature at which the vapor pressure of the liquid equals the pressure surrounding the liquid and the liquid changes into a vapor. The boiling point of a liquid varies depending upon the surrounding environmental pressure.";
